{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月19日，全球半導體股普遍上漲，Anthropic以超出預期的發行價格完成全球規模最大的IPO，提振了市場對人工智能行業及AI基礎設施投資前景的信心。截至發稿，美股盤前，美光科技及SK海力士ADR均漲超5%，英特爾、應用材料、泛林集團及邁威爾科技漲幅介於4%至5%之間，AMD上漲3.4%，博通上漲3.2%，德州儀器上漲2.5%，恩智浦上漲2.2%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587122.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.590063+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:15:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.032232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.032232+00:00","content_hash":"13e4579122383f66b463e7ad7390284fb4af46ff7d46238255bd479a6508509a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}